From: AutoBuild-OpenWrt
Subject: [PATCH] warp: PCI_DMA_FROMDEVICE 改用 DMA_FROM_DEVICE，修复 6.6 编译

PCI_DMA_FROMDEVICE 所在的 include/linux/pci-dma-compat.h 在 Linux 6.4
被整体删除（v6.6 上该文件已不存在），常量改用 dma-direction.h 的
DMA_FROM_DEVICE。

  warp_bm_v2.c: error: 'PCI_DMA_FROMDEVICE' undeclared

厂商树 package/mtk/drivers/warp/src/warp_bm_v2.c 中该处正是
DMA_FROM_DEVICE，此处照做。

--- a/warp_bm_v2.c
+++ b/warp_bm_v2.c
@@ -1169,7 +1169,7 @@
 	for (i = 0; i < ring_len; i++)
 		wed_rx_bm_dma_cb_exit(wed, &ring->cell[i]);
 
-	dma_unmap_single(&wed->pdev->dev, desc->alloc_pa, desc->alloc_size, PCI_DMA_FROMDEVICE);
+	dma_unmap_single(&wed->pdev->dev, desc->alloc_pa, desc->alloc_size, DMA_FROM_DEVICE);
 	warp_os_free_mem(desc->alloc_va);
 	memset(desc, 0, sizeof(*desc));
 
